# Allow-list: only what the image needs. Keeps .asset-risk.json, .geolocate.json, Terraform state and
# vars, .env, the venv and run data out of the build context, so they can't end up in an image layer.
*
!requirements.txt
!app/engine/
!app/front/
app/front/node_modules
app/front/dist
!script/serve.py
!vendor/geolocate/src/
**/__pycache__
